              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\"Eric can't hold on any longer... We had no choice but to give up. I'll leave this notebook here. Maybe this treasure is destined for someone else."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6e9622512e377fb3"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As you may have noticed, the . Otherwise, the other mechanisms cannot be operated."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But there's a catch..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The person operating the mechanism by the door takes on an enormous risk."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If the other mechanisms are operated in the wrong sequence, that person will face..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0757dfa575a9a05d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "One other word of advice:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "... We made that mistake, and paid a painful price."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Perhaps... ?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e88daf47ae14b80b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What is the answer?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Oh, how I wish to know..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
